---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About & The Mind — Prateek Mittal"
  description="The polymathic narrative of Prateek Mittal: bridging high-dimensional medical AI, decision science, clinical ethics, and contemplative poetry."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-14">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-600 dark:text-gold-400 block mb-2">
        The Narrative
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-editorial text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50 tracking-tight mb-4">
        On Science, Stillness & Form
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 font-editorial italic leading-relaxed">
        A personal exploration of how high-dimensional mathematics, healthcare diagnostics, and poetry speak to the same underlying search for harmony.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial Layout -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-start mb-16">
      <div class="md:col-span-5 space-y-4">
        <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-stone-900 shadow-md">
          <img
            src={profile.avatar}
            alt="Prateek Mittal"
            class="w-full h-80 object-cover"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-stone-100/70 dark:bg-stone-900/40 border border-stone-200/80 dark:border-stone-800 text-xs font-mono space-y-1.5 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
          <div><span class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-200 font-semibold">Grassroots:</span> Former Academic Head @ Pratigya Abhiyan</div>
          <div><span class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-200 font-semibold">Current:</span> Ind & Func AI Decision Science Analyst @ Accenture</div>
          <div><span class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-200 font-semibold">Research:</span> VEDAs Lab & Yale BrainLM Contributor</div>
          <div><span class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-200 font-semibold">Initiative:</span> Founder, Foundation for Ethical AI in Healthcare</div>
          <div><span class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-200 font-semibold">Education:</span> BITS Pilani (M.Sc. 9.50) · TIET (B.E. 8.83)</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-7 prose prose-stone dark:prose-invert text-base leading-relaxed space-y-4">
        <p class="font-editorial text-xl italic text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-200 leading-snug">
          "I have never seen mathematics and poetry as separate countries. Both are attempts to express what is vast and subtle using the fewest, most precise tokens possible."
        </p>

        <p>
          Before I ever trained a neural network or decoded an fMRI scan, my conscience was formed on concrete floors with <strong>Pratigya Abhiyan</strong>. Over four years at Thapar Institute—progressing from a volunteer educator to Academic Head—I worked alongside children from socio-economically marginalized families. That experience stripped away any superficial romance about technology: it proved that true intellect is grounded in listening, empathy, and making foundational knowledge accessible.
        </p>

        <p>
          Today, my work lives at the convergence of <strong>empirical precision and human responsibility</strong>. By day within Accenture Strategy & Consulting's AI & Data ecosystem, I navigate decision science and enterprise transformation. Prior to this at Dr. Lal PathLabs, I led production clinical GenAI pipelines serving over 3,000 patient interactions daily, automated document intelligence, and designed unified clinical risk scoring frameworks for Indian demographics.
        </p>

        <p>
          In academic research, I collaborate with the <strong>VEDAs Lab</strong> and contributed to <strong>BrainLM at Yale University</strong>—a foundation model trained on 6,700 hours of fMRI brain recordings (ICLR 2024). At <strong>MICCAI 2026</strong>, our work spans five accepted contributions, including an oral presentation on inverse biological protocol prediction from microscopy imaging and spectral differential geometry (Shape-DNA) of brain lesions.
        </p>

        <p>
          Yet technical capability without moral grounding is dangerous. As the founder of the <strong>Foundation for Ethical AI in Healthcare</strong>, I lead initiatives aimed at closing the regulatory and clinical accountability gap for clinical AI in India.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The Philosophical Horizon & Poetry -->
    <section class="border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 pt-12 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="font-editorial text-3xl font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">
        The Contemplative Stream & Poetry
      </h2>
      <div class="prose prose-stone dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-base leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          When the servers quiet down and the whiteboard markers dry, I write. Sometimes in English, sometimes in the intimate cadence of Hindi verse. My reflections center on <em>भीतर का ठिकाना</em>—the internal sanctuary where one resides when external expectations surge—and <em>क्षीर-नीर विवेक</em>, the classical ideal of intellectual discernment.
        </p>
        <p>
          Whether dissecting a Laplace–Beltrami spectral decomposition or penning a stanza at dawn, the question remains singular: <strong>How do we discern essence from noise?</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Skills & Disciplines -->
      <div class="pt-8 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white/60 dark:bg-stone-900/40">
          <h3 class="font-editorial text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-2">GenAI & Document AI</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 font-mono leading-relaxed">
            RAG pipelines, vector search (FAISS), Azure Document Intelligence, prompt/eval workflows, knowledge graphs.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white/60 dark:bg-stone-900/40">
          <h3 class="font-editorial text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-2">Medical AI & Math</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 font-mono leading-relaxed">
            PyTorch, differential geometry, Laplace-Beltrami analysis, multimodal deep learning, fMRI foundation models.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white/60 dark:bg-stone-900/40">
          <h3 class="font-editorial text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 mb-2">Leadership & Ethics</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 font-mono leading-relaxed">
            Healthcare AI governance, regulatory frameworks, think-tank curation, peer review (ICLR, NeurIPS, TIST).
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Connect Callout -->
    <div class="mt-16 p-8 rounded-2xl bg-parchment-100 dark:bg-ink-850 border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 text-center space-y-4">
      <h3 class="font-editorial text-2xl font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">
        Initiate a Dialogue
      </h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 font-sans max-w-lg mx-auto">
        Whether you wish to discuss research collaborations in medical AI, clinical governance, enterprise decision systems, or simply share a conversation on philosophy and verse.
      </p>
      <div class="pt-2">
        <a
          href="mailto:prateekmittal154@gmail.com"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-stone-900 text-white dark:bg-stone-100 dark:text-stone-900 hover:bg-gold-600 dark:hover:bg-gold-400 text-sm font-medium transition-all shadow-sm"
        >
          <span>Send an Email</span>
          <span>&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
